{"words": [{"text": "أَيَّامًۭا", "translation": "(Fasting for) days"}, {"text": "مَّعْدُودَٰتٍۢ ۚ", "translation": "numbered"}, {"text": "فَمَن", "translation": "So whoever"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "is"}, {"text": "مِنكُم", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "مَّرِيضًا", "translation": "sick"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "سَفَرٍۢ", "translation": "a journey"}, {"text": "فَعِدَّةٌۭ", "translation": "then a prescribed number"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "أَيَّامٍ", "translation": "days"}, {"text": "أُخَرَ ۚ", "translation": "other"}, {"text": "وَعَلَى", "translation": "And on"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "يُطِيقُونَهُۥ", "translation": "can afford it"}, {"text": "فِدْيَةٌۭ", "translation": "a ransom"}, {"text": "طَعَامُ", "translation": "(of) feeding"}, {"text": "مِسْكِينٍۢ ۖ", "translation": "a poor"}, {"text": "فَمَن", "translation": "And whoever"}, {"text": "تَطَوَّعَ", "translation": "volunteers"}, {"text": "خَيْرًۭا", "translation": "good"}, {"text": "فَهُوَ", "translation": "then it"}, {"text": "خَيْرٌۭ", "translation": "(is) better"}, {"text": "لَّهُۥ ۚ", "translation": "for him"}, {"text": "وَأَن", "translation": "And to"}, {"text": "تَصُومُوا۟", "translation": "fast"}, {"text": "خَيْرٌۭ", "translation": "(is) better"}, {"text": "لَّكُمْ ۖ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "translation": "you"}, {"text": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "know"}], "sahih": "[Fasting for] a limited number of days. So whoever among you is ill or on a journey [during them] - then an equal number of other days [are to be made up]. And upon those who are able [to fast, but with hardship] - a ransom [as substitute] of feeding a poor person [each day]. And whoever volunteers good [i.e., excess] - it is better for him. But to fast is best for you, if you only knew."}